# Weftwalking: "When this enchantment enters, if you cast it, shuffle your hand and graveyard into your library, then draw seven cards." Bot1 casts it ({4}{U}{U}: Black Lotus for blue and three Moxen) with Island, Island in hand and Black Lotus in the graveyard, then the hand and graveyard (3 cards: the two Islands and Black Lotus) go into the library, and seven are drawn: the hand is 7 (not 0 and not 3), the graveyard empty, and the library 23 - 7 = 16 cards. Bot2's hand and library are not touched (CR 701.24, 121.1).

